   00001| //! Free-function helpers extracted from `solver.rs` to keep that module under
   00002| //! the 1000-line cap enforced by `scripts/check-file-size.rs`. These helpers
   00003| //! are pure: they do not access any solver state. Items are declared `pub`
   00004| //! inside the `pub(crate)` module so the universal solver in `crate::solver`
   00005| //! can call them directly without exposing them outside the crate.
   00006| //!
   00007| //! Arithmetic evaluation lives in [`crate::arithmetic`] and the offline
   00008| //! concept knowledge base lives in [`crate::concepts`]; this module
   00009| //! re-exports nothing — callers import those modules directly.
