   00589| /// Language-neutral meaning slug for a code fragment, used to key its
   00590| /// `meaning:` evidence link. Delegates to [`formalize_code_meaning`] so the
   00591| /// meaning a fragment translates *through* is the same meaning its trace
   00592| /// records — that shared identity is the #526 round-trip invariant.
   00593| pub fn normalize_code_meaning(code: &str) -> String {
